Heucuva

![[HEUCUVA.gif]]

|  |  |
| --- | --- |
| **CLIMATE/TERRAIN:** | Any |
| **FREQUENCY:** | Very rare |
| **ORGANIZATION:** | Solitary |
| **ACTIVITY CYCLE:** | Any |
